      "explanation": "This text describes the passage of a symbolic resolution honoring the life of the late Senator Thomas F. Eagleton. Commemorative resolutions and tribute statements are akin to condolence messages and do not represent credit-claiming for a material government policy outcome benefiting constituents."
    }
  ]
}

